    "text": "Internet ab phir se normal ho gaya! 🌐\nDawn ke mutabiq Pakistan Telecommunication Authority (PTA) ne Saturday ko bataya ke SEA-ME-WE 5 (SMW5) submarine cable ki kharabi theek kar di gayi hai aur mulk bhar mein internet services normal ho gayi hain. Yeh kharabi 18 November ko Pakistan ke sahil se taqreeban 11 kilometre door samne aayi thi. PTA ke mutabiq Transworld Associates (TWA) aur international SMW5 consortium ne mil kar cable theek ki, aur is dauran internet traffic ko doosre international raston se chalaya gaya taake kam se kam masla ho. Pakistan ko 7 submarine cables se internet milta hai.\nKya aap ka internet ab theek chal raha hai? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #PTA #Internet #SMW5 #PakistanNews",
